">\n          ♨️ 温泉・お風呂\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-amber-200\">お風呂 ★ 4.37 / 5.0</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>設備:</strong> 温泉・大浴場・露天風呂・家族風呂・天然温泉（熱川温泉 一柳閣・静岡県）</li>\n        <li><strong>泉質:</strong> 硫酸塩泉・ナトリウム塩化物泉</li>\n        <li><strong>効能:</strong> 肩凝り・美肌効果・疲労回復</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- お食事・グルメ -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          🍽️ 熱川温泉 一柳閣のお食事スタイルと料理のこだわり\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-orange-700 bg-orange-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-orange-200\">夕食★4.44 / 朝食★4.36</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>朝食:</strong> 部屋</li>\n        <li><strong>夕食:</strong> 部屋</li>\n        <li><strong>宿の特長:</strong> 【蜜を避けた完全部屋食の宿】眺望絶佳の温泉宿で波音と共にお過ごし下さい。！</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 駐車場・アクセス -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          🚗 駐車場・交通アクセス\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-emerald-200\">立地 ★4.63</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>駐車場:</strong> 有り　３０台　無料 　当館入口前にお車をお付け下さい。係りがご移動致します。</li>\n        <li><strong>アクセス:</strong> 伊豆急行線・伊豆熱川駅／小田原厚木道路・西湖バイパス・石橋ＩＣ～熱海経由～Ｒ１３５号線を６５ｋ